# Lane BE-3b work log (append-only) — integration/auth continuation

Spec: docs/be3.log "Deferred remainder". Items: (1) chatgpt/azure/gitlab/
snowflake/openai OAuth variants; (2) copilot transport binding; (3) wellknown
config-graph resolution; (4) console provider-catalog ingestion; (5) runtime
connection.status reporters.

